Note: KitePlayer contains no FFmpeg code of its own; it uses KiteFFmpeg, which binds
to FFmpeg. The FFmpeg that KiteFFmpeg publishes is LGPL-2.1-or-later; KiteFFmpeg
publishes no GPL build. An FFmpeg tree you build yourself with --enable-gpl carries
the GPL instead. Respect each of the licences involved.
